WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.910
Mix 10 grams of hydrogen with 10
grams of oxygen, and ignite them.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:10.210
They react to make water, and the reaction
keeps going until one of them is used up.

3
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.790
Equal masses go in.

4
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.410
So which one runs out first?

5
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.010
Mix 10 grams of hydrogen
with 10 grams of oxygen.

6
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.770
Which runs out first?

7
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.450
In this mission, you'll
find the limiting reactant,

8
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.390
and see why it fixes the
most product you can make.

9
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.310
You'll work out how much of the
other reactant is left over,

10
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.710
and meet theoretical
and experimental yield.

11
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.330
Your mission: decide which runs
out first, hydrogen or oxygen.
